__pycache__/
*.pyc
.aga-*
.DS_Store
audio/
*.log

# ─── PII: never commit data-store dumps to this repo ─────────────────────────
# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC.
#
# backup_data.py writes one JSON per data store to backups/<date>/. The
# call_scores dump carries contact_name (the PROSPECT's name), rep_name,
# summary (the AI's write-up of the call) and recording_sid. ~500 such records
# were committed here in June 2026 and later deleted from HEAD — they remain in
# this repo's public history.
#
# The ONLY reason it stopped is that the read API began returning 401
# Unauthorized (all 91 tracked snapshots record call_scores as an error string).
# That is an accident, not a control: the write path in backup_data.py is
# intact, the workflow still runs `git add backups/` and pushes, and nothing
# here excluded these files. Repairing that credential would have silently
# resumed publishing prospect PII at 04:00 UTC — a fix that reopens a leak.
#
# Keep _summary.json (counts only, no PII) so the snapshot index still works.
backups/*/*.json
!backups/*/_summary.json
